{
  "title": "Hearty Shattering Syrian Eggplant Stew",
  "description": "A traditional Syrian stew featuring eggplant and ferment-jang, this dish is both flavorful and nutritious. It is a one-pot meal that is shojin-friendly.",
  "cuisine": "Syrian",
  "diet": [
